flowchart LR
    Push[Push or pull request] --> CI[Checkout + pinned JDK/SDK]
    CI --> Validate[Gradle validation]
    Validate --> Checks[Lint + unit + instrumentation tests]
    Checks --> Debug[Build debug APK]
    Checks --> Release[Build release APK]
    Checks --> Bundle[Build release AAB]
    Debug --> Upload[Upload CI artifacts]
    Release --> Upload
    Bundle --> Upload
    Tag[Version tag v*] --> ReleaseCI[Release workflow]
    ReleaseCI --> Test[Tests + lint]
    Test --> Sign[Sign from GitHub Secrets]
    Sign --> Verify[Verify artifacts]
    Verify --> GitHub[Create GitHub Release]

    classDef trigger fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef check fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef artifact fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef release fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#581c87,stroke-width:1.5px
    class Push,Tag trigger
    class CI,Validate,Checks,ReleaseCI,Test check
    class Debug,Release,Bundle,Upload,Sign,Verify artifact
    class GitHub release
